          "chords-and-harmony.txt": textFile(
            `CHORDS AND HARMONY\n==================\n\nTriads (stacked thirds):\nMajor       1 3 5\nMinor       1 b3 5\nDiminished  1 b3 b5\nAugmented   1 3 #5\n\nSeventh chords:\nMaj7  1 3 5 7\nDom7  1 3 5 b7\nMin7  1 b3 5 b7\nm7b5  1 b3 b5 b7\n\nSuspended: sus2 (1 2 5) and sus4 (1 4 5).\nAdded: add9 (1 3 5 9), 6 (1 3 5 6).\n\nDiatonic chords in a major key:\nI    ii   iii   IV   V   vi   vii dim\nC    Dm   Em    F    G   Am   Bdim\n\nWith sevenths:\nImaj7  iim7  iiim7  IVmaj7  V7  vim7  viim7b5\n\nThe V7 chord has a tritone between its 3rd and b7th, which wants to resolve to the tonic.`,
