          "setup-log.log": textFile(
            `2026-01-10  Strings: 10-46 fitted. Relief 0.010 in. Action 12th fret: low E 2.0 mm, high E 1.6 mm.\n2026-01-10  Tremolo: 4 springs, floating, plate level.\n2026-01-10  Intonation checked all six strings. B string moved back 1 mm.\n2026-03-14  Strings changed. Light buzz at fret 3, added a touch of relief.\n2026-03-14  Pickup heights reset, neck pickup lowered slightly to reduce string pull.\n2026-05-02  Cleaned pots with contact cleaner. Volume pot no longer crackles.\n2026-05-02  Lubricated nut slots with graphite.\n2026-06-20  Summer humidity: neck moved forward slightly. Tightened truss rod an eighth turn.\n2026-08-15  Replaced worn tone capacitor with a .022 uF unit. Roll off sounds smoother.\n2026-10-01  Fresh strings, full setup check. Everything within spec.`,
