        practice: directory({
          "daily-routine.txt": textFile(
            `DAILY PRACTICE ROUTINE\n======================\n\n30 minutes:\n- 5 min: warm up (spider walk, chromatic exercise)\n- 5 min: scales with a metronome\n- 10 min: new song or technique\n- 5 min: chord changes\n- 5 min: improvisation over a backing track\n\nRules:\n- Slow and clean beats fast and sloppy\n- Use a metronome\n- Record yourself\n- Practise a little every day rather than a lot once a week`,
