          "practice-log.log": textFile(
            `2026-09-01  20:00  30 min. A minor pentatonic box 1 and 2 at 80 bpm.\n2026-09-03  19:30  45 min. Worked on bends and vibrato. Pitch is getting better.\n2026-09-06  21:00  60 min. Learned the verse of Little Wing.\n2026-09-10  20:15  30 min. 12 bar blues in A, shuffle rhythm at 100 bpm.\n2026-09-14  19:45  40 min. CAGED shapes for G major.\n2026-09-20  20:30  50 min. Improvised over a Dorian backing track.\n2026-09-27  19:00  35 min. Recorded a take of Pride and Joy.\n2026-10-04  20:10  45 min. Practised hybrid picking and double stops.\n2026-10-12  19:50  40 min. Circle of fifths drill, played I IV V in six keys.\n2026-10-20  21:05  60 min. Full run through of the set. 7 songs from memory.\n\nGoal: practise at least 5 days a week.`,
